{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-14",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "成为入室弟子  (Becoming the Boss's Apprentice)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After days of intensive coaching, Chun Yuqiao has spent so much time answering Bu Xiaogu's questions that even urgent contracts sit unsigned on his desk. Listen to Yuqiao, Xingzi, and Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在还有其他问题吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "基本没有了，暂时没有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，那份合同签完了吗？那边催得挺紧的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还没有来得及看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对不起啊，我耽误你时间了，我一会儿再来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，你知道总编室为什么不带新人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "因为只要带新人，老大就会无比认真。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果新人有一点笨的话，老大投入的时间和精力就会无限量地多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "恭喜你，正式成为老大的入室弟子！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在还有其他问题吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have any other questions left now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "基本没有了，暂时没有。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pretty much none; none for the moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，那份合同签完了吗？那边催得挺紧的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, have you finished signing that contract? They are pressing quite urgently.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还没有来得及看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have not had time to read it yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对不起啊，我耽误你时间了，我一会儿再来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sorry for taking up your time; I will come back later.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，你知道总编室为什么不带新人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, do you know why the chief editor's office does not train newcomers?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "因为只要带新人，老大就会无比认真。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because whenever he mentors someone, our boss takes it seriously beyond measure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果新人有一点笨的话，老大投入的时间和精力就会无限量地多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If the newcomer is even a bit slow, the time and energy our boss pours in becomes limitless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "恭喜你，正式成为老大的入室弟子！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Congratulations on officially becoming our boss's personal apprentice!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在还有其他问题吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "基本没有了，暂时没有。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大，那份合同签完了吗？那边催得挺紧的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "还没有来得及看。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "对不起啊，我耽误你时间了，我一会儿再来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，你知道总编室为什么不带新人吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "因为只要带新人，老大就会无比认真。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果新人有一点笨的话，老大投入的时间和精力就会无限量地多。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "恭喜你，正式成为老大的入室弟子！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xingzi laughs that Yuqiao's limitless patience with Xiaogu makes her his very first personal apprentice in the chief editor's office. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
